---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Naveen Rajan — engineer, founder, and researcher."
>
  <div class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>

    <h1>A little about me.</h1>

    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I'm an engineer interested in artificial intelligence,
        software, and building things that are actually useful.
      </p>

      <p>
        My interests sit somewhere between engineering, research,
        and entrepreneurship. I'm particularly interested in what
        happens when new technology makes previously impractical
        ideas possible.
      </p>

      <p>
        This website is where I keep track of things I'm building,
        researching, learning, and writing about.
      </p>

      <h2>Interests</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Artificial intelligence</li>
        <li>Software engineering</li>
        <li>AI systems and infrastructure</li>
        <li>Startups and technology</li>
        <li>Open source</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>

      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/navrjn">GitHub ↗</a><br />
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/navrjn">LinkedIn ↗</a><br />
        <a href="mailto:hello@navrjn.com">Email ↗</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 90px 0;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    margin: 20px 0 60px;
  }

  .content {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .content p {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 60px 0 20px;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  li {
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  a {
    color: #ddd;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: white;
  }
</style>
